# Category Performance Executive Briefing

## Worked Operational Narratives

### May Ethnic Wear (+77.10% MoM Expansion)
* **CONTEXT:** Performance audit for Ethnic Wear category revenue comparing April baseline to May.
* **INSIGHT (FACT):** Ethnic Wear revenue expanded by +77.10% MoM, rising from INR 104,520.77 in April to INR 185,107.61 in May.
* **IMPLICATION (HYPOTHESIS):** Demand was accelerated by early regional festival preparation and new seller catalog listings; category leads should verify supplier stock depth to sustain momentum.

### June Ethnic Wear (-58.74% MoM Contraction)
* **CONTEXT:** Performance audit for Ethnic Wear category revenue comparing May baseline to June.
* **INSIGHT (FACT):** Ethnic Wear revenue contracted by -58.74% MoM, falling from INR 185,107.61 in May to INR 76,371.53 in June.
* **IMPLICATION (HYPOTHESIS):** Natural post-promotional cooling following May spikes; category leads should review reseller active listing counts and schedule partner re-engagement outreach.
